# The live POESESSID. Never commit.
secrets.json

# The SQLite archive, the stats cache and the generated mod table. All of it is
# regenerable, and the database does not live here anyway — see README.
#
# ANCHORED with a leading slash, and that matters: an unanchored "data/" also
# matches site/data/, which is where the published JSON lives. It did, and the
# three files the page cannot work without were silently left out of the first
# commit of site/. tests/gitignore.test.mjs now guards it.
/data/

# The rate-limit ledger. It is live local state, not source: it holds the exact
# time of every request this machine made to GGG, and this repository is public.
# It was committed after each sweep until 2026-09-12. lib/rate-limiter.mjs still
# reads and writes it in place, so untracking it changes no behaviour.
/.claude/skills/price-check/data/.cache/ratelimit.json

